rm{ZfcFuncProjectionOperator}_S(P,X,k,+_X,\\odot_X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(P,X,X,k,+_X,\\odot_X,+_X,\\odot_X)\\land P\\circ P=P\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}func\\text{-}projection\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFuncProjectionOperator}_S(P,X,k,+_X,\\odot_X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(P,X,X,k,+_X,\\odot_X,+_X,\\odot_X)\\land P\\circ P=P\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is an idempotent linear endomorphism relative to explicit vector-space structure, not a coordinate projection of a product.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-linear-map","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-linear-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-linear-map","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-linear-map]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,X,k,+_X,\\odot_X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFuncProjectionOperator}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}func\\text{-}projection\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFuncProjectionOperator}_S(P,X,k,+_X,\\odot_X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(P,X,X,k,+_X,\\odot_X,+_X,\\odot_X)\\land P\\circ P=P","display":true}],"bytes":895,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2154","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-func-projection-op